aveling so much, and he was always busy. But he really wanted to be into the drums. It's hard for a father and son to - on instruments to teach, especially. I'm not a good teacher. I can't teach. A person has to - this is the way I feel about it, anyhow. My approach to the instrument. I don't have the words. I ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q6429$2D71045F-DE6A-4A18-AA05-26E0EAE7DD06", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "6541006187290b52a7bb36cd2b6907aef281020b", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/d2d2f0855ed7ab603676e951a4fa571c/756.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q6429$A7116556-63B6-4110-A258-D848DFCFD602", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "3d87d8fc4bfe719060b40902681759199a913cb8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 461, "id": "Q461"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q6429$344E389F-7FF4-4571-AB8C-119DFD37D14E", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "4962374b9b61d424dfce49846d93b4ab71aef038", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 427, "id": "Q427"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q6429$ADB67E8A-F3E2-4BB4-8684-B2254689766F", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "a6fb547c86266a636f9b75d66039dd60c684a3e5", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 427, "id": "Q427"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q6429$5D1B69A5-F2B3-4579-BBBF-404E917E7C10", "rank": "normal"}]}}